    <string name="about_title">About Verimots</string>
    <string name="about_body">Offline first: the selected list (forms of 2 to 15 letters) checks a word and runs the games with no network.\n\nDefinitions come from Wiktionary (CC BY-SA 4.0): a free source, sometimes incomplete or wrong, and not those of any official dictionary. Definitions and sharing need a connection.\n\nVerimots is an independent, free, ad-free project. Its word lists are community-built: they are not ODS, CSW, NWL or the FILE Lexicón and may differ from them. No official compliance is claimed; Verimots is not a tournament adjudicator.\n\nNo affiliation with Larousse, FISF, FFSc, HarperCollins, NASPA, WESPA, WGPO, RAE, FILE, Mattel or Hasbro. SCRABBLE is a trademark of Mattel (outside the USA and Canada) and Hasbro (USA and Canada).</string>
