    <string name="training_rules_title">Combinations — the rules</string>
    <string name="training_rules_body">Find every word in the rack. Type a word and submit; used tiles grey out.\n\n• All — every word from 2 to 7 letters counts.\n• 7 letters — only words using all 7 letters count.\n• 8 letters — same, with an 8-tile rack.\n• 7 + 1 — a shuffled 7-letter word plus one bonus tile (gold outline): find the 8-letter words.\n• Joker — the ? stands for any letter (0 points).\n• Hard — the rack contains J, K, Q, W, X, Y or Z.\n• Short words — a short 3–5 tile rack: only the 2- and 3-letter words count.\n\n“Hint” shows the definition of a remaining word (it turns orange once found). “Reveal a word” shows it in red.\n\n“Reveal answers” ends the round and shows the list.\n\nThis mode is unranked: your stats stay on this device.</string>
